SUMMARY:Moonlight Garden photography exhibition at Pensacola State College
LOCATION:Switzer Gallery\, Pensacola State College\, 1000 College Boulevard
 \, Building 15\, Pensacola\, FL 32504
DESCRIPTION:Through Friday 12/11 · Mon to Thu 9 AM to 5 PM\, Fri 9 AM to 3
  PM\n\nPhotographer Mark Alan Francis shows landscape prints made with the
  Mordançage process\, which gives black and white silver gelatin prints e
 arth tones of copper\, tan and burnt sienna. The pictures look like they w
 ere taken at night under moonlight. It runs in the Switzer Gallery through
  Friday 12/11 and is a quiet stop on a weekday.\n\nPrice: No published pri
 ce\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-psc-moonlight-garden
 -exhibition-1118.html
