  participants get a long sleeve t-shirt and are encouraged to dress for th
 e holidays. The 5K Fun Run costs $30 and registration closes December 4 at
  6 AM.\n\nPrice: from $30\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/
 ev-navarre-jingle-bell-run-5k-1205.html
