 541 (count circle centered north of the Marler Bridge over East Pass)
DESCRIPTION:Saturday 12/19\n\nChoctawhatchee Audubon takes part in the worl
 dwide Christmas Bird Count on December 19. The count circle is centered no
 rth of the Marler Bridge and covers Fort Walton Beach\, Valparaiso\, Nicev
